/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1557639258/3/prompt.md:173:Key insight: Red marker geometry (line vs single pixel) determines reflection type; isolated vs embedded red determines what gets reflected.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1557639258/3/prompt.md:174:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1557639258/3/prompt.md:175:</reference_puzzle>
